  "_comment": "Negative: a value squatting the urn:rkaf:fragment: namespace while the record declares rkaf:published-fragment, so the compiled conditional never fires and the value meets only the generic absolute-IRI pattern. Registering the derived form has to mean the namespace is checked wherever it appears, not merely wherever a producer volunteers the declaration. Caught by rkaf:ConceptAssignmentCarrierLocalEvidenceDeclaredShape, which is a per-VALUE conditional keyed on that value's own lexical form — something CUE's list-of-string carrier, with its single pattern, cannot express (§4.2)."
